### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Readiness gated by frozen evidence integrity
GET http://localhost:8000/ready

### Frozen provenance verification
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/provenance

### Same-valid-time forecast-lead sensitivity (NOT a physical trajectory)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/lead-evolution

### Frozen alert
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/alerts/96

### GeoJSON
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/geojson

### Stage-2 request
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/refinement-request/96

### Generic severity
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/severity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "max_ensemble_mean_wind_ms": 18.0,
  "max_efi": 0.85,
  "max_member_support_fraction": 0.4,
  "mean_seed_agreement": 0.9,
  "max_sot": 2.0
}

### Generic alert evaluation
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/alerts/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "DEMO_EVENT",
  "valid_time": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "forecast_lead_hours": 72,
  "core_lat": 18.0,
  "core_lon": 88.0,
  "macro_footprint_area_km2": 20000,
  "macro_footprint_geojson": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[[87.8,17.8],[88.2,17.8],[88.2,18.2],[87.8,18.2],[87.8,17.8]]]
  },
  "evidence": {
    "max_ensemble_mean_wind_ms": 18.0,
    "max_efi": 0.85,
    "max_member_support_fraction": 0.4,
    "mean_seed_agreement": 0.9,
    "max_sot": 2.0
  }
}

### Software-only temporal track-object construction
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tracks/build
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "SOFTWARE_TRACK_DEMO",
  "frames": [
    {
      "valid_time": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "forecast_lead_hours": 120,
      "core_lat": 16.0,
      "core_lon": 87.0,
      "macro_footprint_geojson": {"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[86.8,15.8],[87.2,15.8],[87.2,16.2],[86.8,16.2],[86.8,15.8]]]}
    },
    {
      "valid_time": "2026-01-01T06:00:00Z",
      "forecast_lead_hours": 114,
      "core_lat": 16.5,
      "core_lon": 87.5,
      "macro_footprint_geojson": {"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[87.3,16.3],[87.7,16.3],[87.7,16.7],[87.3,16.7],[87.3,16.3]]]}
    }
  ]
}
